<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of women's doubles</p>
<p>semifinals at Wimbledon on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding)</p>
<p>6-Nicole Arendt (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) beat</p>
<p>4-Larisa Neiland (Latvia)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 6-2 3-6</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat</p>
<p>12-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)/Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
